Subject: [Smithay ff5fa7df] Backport compositor text-input helpers

Backport only the text-injection helpers from Smithay commit
be920fb5d41096bc3d57e432b7035f4bc2a4e58c (feat: add `ei_text` support),
as used by the previously tested ANiri dependency 4cf0b62028039661477d482ec4758b687d8f4392.
Adapt text-input request handling to the release's Dispatch API. Do not import
the newer libei backend, unrelated APIs or any niri/Anland backend sources.

This keeps the current adapter's Android text-input-v3 and keyboard fallback
behavior on niri v26.04 without advancing its locked dependency versions.
The compositor-input-method flag defaults to false for other backends.

